{
  "slug": "denver-colfax-marathon",
  "title": "Run50 #第8州｜科罗拉多：丹佛 Colfax 马拉松｜里高城的26.2英里",
  "page": "/run50/wechat/denver-colfax-marathon-modern-rail.html",
  "status": "pending",
  "entry_fix": false,
  "intro": "生日后的第一个周末，去丹佛点亮科罗拉多：老同学、阳光、雪山、球场，以及里高城的 26.2英里 。",
  "map": "/assets/cn-article-maps/us-light-90c87d48b72b3b65.png",
  "poster": "../../assets/cover-medal-zh-index-denver-cn-flat.jpg?v=20260630-round4-v1",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>办公室的同门Huan今年<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">3月</strong>份毕业，并且已经在丹佛找到了一份博后的职位。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在他毕业前，我调侃，让他在丹佛请吃饭，另外，我确实也没去过美国正中间的科罗拉多州，对于这个在NBA世界里存在感挺强的城市，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">我也很好奇</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>要去，也需要一个motivation。所以我就进行了一番调研，发现五月二十一日，丹佛会举办当地最大的马拉松比赛——<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">Colfax</strong>马拉松。看起来还不错，而且正好也是我生日后的第一个周末，521听上去也好听。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-001.webp",
      "caption": "Run The @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 001"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>就这样，从Huan答应在丹佛请吃饭，到我们订下机票和酒店，不过一个下午和晚上的时间，打着看老同学的旗号，我和<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">47</strong>决定去点亮科罗拉多。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "丹佛，阳光下的里高城"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>🏔️ Denver, Colorado</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>丹佛是个好地方，这里不仅有约基奇，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">还有最好的阳光</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>丹佛四季分明，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">每年超过300天都是阳光灿烂的晴天</strong>。这比圣地亚哥或迈阿密海滩的阳光明媚天数还要多。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-002.webp",
      "caption": "Denver @Google · 资料图",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 002"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-003.webp",
      "caption": "The Mile · 资料图",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 003"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>“丹佛”与“阳光”，让人耳边不禁回响起约翰·丹佛（John Denver）的那首《阳光照在我肩上》：Sunshine on my shoulders makes me happy…I'd make a wish for sunshine for all the while. 在这里，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">你的心情永远会被阳光治愈</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-004.webp",
      "caption": "The Mile · 2 · 资料图",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 004"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>丹佛曾在历史上被称为草原上的女王城（Queen city of the Plains），丹佛所处的地理位置平均海拔高度为5280英尺，也就是1610米，约一英里，因此丹佛又被人亲切地称为“一英里高的城市”（The Mile High City），<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">即别名“里高之城”</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-005.webp",
      "caption": "The Mile · 3 · 资料图",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 005"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-006.webp",
      "caption": "Starry Night · 资料图",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 006"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>所以科罗拉多州虽是大麻合法州，但这里的 “high” ，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">可跟大麻没有半毛钱关系</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>如果来丹佛，只能去一点地方，那一定是”丹佛掘金队“…….，那一定是丹佛最美景点，红岩剧场 - Red Rock Park and Amphitheater，在此特别感谢Huan同学，开车带我们去到了距离丹佛市中心往西有<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">12英里</strong>的红岩公园。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-007.webp",
      "caption": "Red Rock @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 007"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-008.webp",
      "caption": "Red Rock · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 008"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-009.webp",
      "caption": "Red Rock · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 009"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>其实去之前我们对这里并没有太多期待，因为谷歌地图里看上去也就一般般，不过到了红岩公园，确实觉得很<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">惊喜</strong>，红岩剧场就坐落在红岩公园里。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-010.webp",
      "caption": "Red Rock · 4 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 010"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-011.webp",
      "caption": "Red Rock · 5 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 011"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>红岩剧场是世界上唯一利用天然山体所修建的露天剧场，历经了3亿年的沧海桑田。这里每年的5月至9月的夜晚都会举行夏日音乐节，邀请最顶尖的爵士、摇滚、流行音乐人前来演出。英国的披头士乐队（<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">The Beatles</strong>） <span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">第一次</span>登陆美国首演就选在这里。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-012.webp",
      "caption": "Red Rock · 6 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 012"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-013.webp",
      "caption": "Red Rock · 7 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 013"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>当年朱镕基总理访美来到丹佛，也在这个举世无双的剧场里聆听了一场音乐会。想象一下，头顶璀璨星空，环视红砂珠壁，被音乐之声在大山中的回音所环抱。站在红岩剧场旁的岩石上还可以远眺丹佛市区，downtown的高楼大厦就像山下宽广平原上的海市蜃楼，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">犹如幻象......</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-014.webp",
      "caption": "Red Rock · 8 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 014"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-015.webp",
      "caption": "Red Rock · 9 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 015"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-016.webp",
      "caption": "Red Rock · 10 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 016"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-017.webp",
      "caption": "Red Rock Park @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 017"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>其实除了自然景观，丹佛的每个街头都有着独特的人文风情，整个城市都很时尚。<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">最直接的感受就是涂鸦真的多</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-018.webp",
      "caption": "Larimer Square · 资料图",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 018"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-019.webp",
      "caption": "Larimer Square · 2 · 资料图",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 019"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-020.webp",
      "caption": "Larimer Square @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 020"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>其中的拉里默广场（<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">Larimer Square</strong>）诞生于1800年代后期，是丹佛的第一个街区、第一个商业区、第一个住宅、第一个市政厅的所在地，当然，自然也是丹佛最古老的街区，同时也是年轻人聚集最多的地方。随着时间的推移，丹佛的市中心也汇聚于此。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-021.webp",
      "caption": "City Park @Google · 资料图",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 021"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-022.webp",
      "caption": "Civic Center Park @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 022"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>丹佛的公园真的超级多，据说市内就有<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">200</strong>多个公园。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-023.webp",
      "caption": "City Park @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 023"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-024.webp",
      "caption": "City Park · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 024"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-025.webp",
      "caption": "City Park · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 025"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-026.webp",
      "caption": "City Park · 4 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我们也顺路去了市政中心公园（Civic Center Park）和城市公园（City Park），这两个公园都很精致，其中丹佛动物园就在City Park里，半马路线会经过。周六这天，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">我们正好赶上城市公园门口的早市</strong>，人来人往的，很热闹，很生活，真挺好。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "丹佛马拉松，博览会"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>🏔️ <strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">Denver</strong>, Colorado</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>丹佛科尔法克斯马拉松的Expo在Empower Field at Mile High举行，这个体育场非常壮观！它是美国NFL丹佛野马队的主场，能容纳超过<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">76</strong>,000名观众。这个体育场于2001年建成，并举办了许多重大体育赛事，包括超级碗和国际足球联合会杯。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-027.webp",
      "caption": "田野风景 · 资料图",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 027"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Colfax马博览会并没有飞猪那样气派，并且还有一些狭窄和拥挤。不过，就像飞猪马一样，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">丹佛马也会给跑者一张色彩斑斓的海报</strong>，工作人员还特别热情地给我们拍了一张照片。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-028.webp",
      "caption": "Colfax Expo @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 028"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-029.webp",
      "caption": "Colfax Expo · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 029"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在马博会出口处，有一个马拉松纪念品商店，我也买了一顶帽子留作纪念，上面还有Colfax的标志，斯凯勒·科尔法克斯（Schuyler Colfax）对于丹佛来说是个很重要的人物，他曾担任美国第17任副总统，并带领科罗拉多州获得了州份。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-030.webp",
      "caption": "Colfax Expo · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 030"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>取完马拉松T恤和号码布，我们在体育场外见到了Huan，然后我们一起在科罗拉多大学转了一圈在那之后，Huan请我们吃了一顿很棒的川菜。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-031.webp",
      "caption": "Sichuan Dinner @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 031"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "周年，丹佛科尔法克斯马拉松"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>🏔️ Denver, Colorado</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>丹佛科尔法克斯马拉松，是科罗拉多州最大的跑步活动，这个比赛有超过20,000名参与者，今年（2023）是比赛的第17届，比赛包括全程马拉松、半程马拉松、<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">10英里</span>赛、<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">5公里</span>赛以及美国最大的马拉松接力赛。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-032.webp",
      "caption": "Colfax Marathon · 资料图",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 032"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>马拉松世界称Colfax马是丹佛的终极城市之旅，比赛从丹佛城市公园（City Park）出发并结束。途经里高Empower球场——两次！并穿越丹佛消防局1号车站，沿着七英里的河流、湖泊和桥梁——包括Sloan湖。还可以穿越多样化的社区，历史悠久的Lakewood，繁忙的科尔法克斯大道，丹佛市中心，以及看到壮丽的落基山色。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-033.webp",
      "caption": "City Park @Siqi",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 033"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-034.webp",
      "caption": "City Park @Siqi · 2",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 034"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>比赛日，5月21日，天还没大亮，我们就前往了City Park，起点处有挺多牌子适合拍照，起点处人挺多的，但却并不拥挤，不同的分组会分枪起跑，我被分到了N组。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-035.webp",
      "caption": "Corral-N @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 035"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在我前面粉头发小哥我在去年的印第安纳牦牛马上也见过，他戴的翅膀上贴满了照片，跑起来应该不会孤单。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-036.webp",
      "caption": "Pink Buddy @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 036"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>很有趣的是，每次出发时，现场的DJ都会进行倒计时。在不断循环的倒计时中，终于轮到了我们N组出发了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-037.webp",
      "caption": "Go @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 037"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-038.webp",
      "caption": "Go · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 038"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>丹佛的早晨不冷不热，很舒服，里高城的海拔也没有成为我的困扰，伴着并不刺眼的阳光，我们在City Park里打了个转，并在出口的公园出口的Thatcher Fountain旁边，迎来了第一个英里的指示牌。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-039.webp",
      "caption": "City Park · 5 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 039"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-040.webp",
      "caption": "City Park · 6 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 040"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我挺喜欢丹佛的英里牌，很有城市特色，每一个都值得收藏。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-041.webp",
      "caption": "Mile 1 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 041"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-042.webp",
      "caption": "Mile 1 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 042"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>离开City Park，在科尔法克斯大道（Colfax Avenue）上转弯时，我们经过了猫王（Elvis）模仿者亚伦·布莱克（Aaron Black），很多人停下来和他拍照。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-043.webp",
      "caption": "Elvis @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 043"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>然后我们一路向西，这段路城会经过各色各样的商店、酒吧和餐馆，直达丹佛的市中心。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-044.webp",
      "caption": "Colfax Avenue @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 044"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-045.webp",
      "caption": "Colfax Avenue · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 045"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-046.webp",
      "caption": "赛道跑者 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 046"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-047.webp",
      "caption": "Mile 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 047"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在经过国会大厦和市民中心公园之后，我们迎来了本场比赛最有特色的一部分：穿过丹佛第一消防站，并在这里受到消防员们的欢呼！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-048.webp",
      "caption": "Colfax Avenue · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 048"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-049.webp",
      "caption": "Colfax Avenue · 4 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 049"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-050.webp",
      "caption": "Denver Fire @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 050"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>丹佛第一消防站的出口处会有一个补给点，这时候天气也稍微热了起来，在加上跑了的3个英里，感觉有点热。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-051.webp",
      "caption": "Denver Fire · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 051"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我觉得是时候变身了！就按照原计划，我在这里脱掉了那件蓝色的外套，顺手把它留给了垃圾桶先生，然后继续继续前进。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-052.webp",
      "caption": "Denver Fire · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 052"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>离开丹佛消防局，我们沿着樱桃溪小径（Cherry Creek Trail）一路向北，这段路阴阴凉凉的很舒服，还可以听到哗哗的流水声，很惬意。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-053.webp",
      "caption": "Cherry Creek Trail @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 053"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-054.webp",
      "caption": "Cherry Creek Trail · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 054"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-055.webp",
      "caption": "Mile 4 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 055"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这边有补给点和厕所，但是厕所要排队，我也不想等太久，就想着去下一个厕所点，没想到，这一等，就是好多个miles，跑的很辛苦。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-056.webp",
      "caption": "Cherry Creek Trail · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 056"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-057.webp",
      "caption": "Cherry Creek Trail · 4 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 057"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-058.webp",
      "caption": "路上跑者 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 058"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>大约在<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">5英里</span>处，所有的跑者都向左转，来到埃利奇花园（Elitch Garden），一路沿着南普拉特河（South Platte River）向南前进。在这段路上，我还看到了两位穿着掘金队服的跑者，小波特和默里，挺有趣的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-059.webp",
      "caption": "水边风景 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 059"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-060.webp",
      "caption": "Cherry Creek Trail · 5 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 060"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-061.webp",
      "caption": "Cherry Creek Trail · 6 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 061"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-062.webp",
      "caption": "Elitch Garden @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 062"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-063.webp",
      "caption": "Elitch Garden · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 063"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-064.webp",
      "caption": "Elitch Garden · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 064"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-065.webp",
      "caption": "Elitch Garden · 4 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 065"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>随着我们在老17桥（Old 17th Avenue Bridge）的右转，所有跑者即将迎来这次跑步的巅峰时刻：穿梭里高体育场（Empower Field at Mile High）</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-066.webp",
      "caption": "田野风景 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 066"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-067.webp",
      "caption": "田野风景 · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 067"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-068.webp",
      "caption": "田野风景 · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 068"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-069.webp",
      "caption": "田野风景 · 4 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "田野风景 · 4 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我们会沿着观众席和草场的warning track绕场半圈离开，这边会有很多摄影师，仪式感拉满。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>经历过史诗级的体育场穿越，我们又回到了科尔法克斯大道，这段向西跑的路线，所有跑着会正背对着阳光，时刻追逐着自己的影子。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-070.webp",
      "caption": "田野风景 · 5 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 070"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-071.webp",
      "caption": "Back to @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 071"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-072.webp",
      "caption": "Colfax Avenue · 5 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 072"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>大约跑了一个英里，我们来到了斯隆湖（Sloan Lake）。在这里，还有三个英里等着大家。在斯隆湖的入口处，还会有华人小朋友表演舞狮和打鼓，非常热闹！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-073.webp",
      "caption": "Sloan Lake @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 073"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-074.webp",
      "caption": "Sloan Lake · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 074"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-075.webp",
      "caption": "Sloan Lake Mile-8 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 075"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>斯隆湖的路线非常舒服，我还在这里享受了一次宜人的厕所体验，瞬间感觉轻松了很多。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-076.webp",
      "caption": "水边风景 · 2 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "水边风景 · 2 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-077.webp",
      "caption": "水边风景 · 3 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "水边风景 · 3 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-078.webp",
      "caption": "水边风景 · 4 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "水边风景 · 4 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-079.webp",
      "caption": "水边风景 · 5 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "水边风景 · 5 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-080.webp",
      "caption": "Sloan Lake Mile-9 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 080"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-081.webp",
      "caption": "Sloan Lake · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 081"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-082.webp",
      "caption": "Sloan Lake · 4 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 082"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我相信这里一定是当地跑步爱好者的热门聚集地，这里有着令人惊叹的山景和市景，而且路面非常平坦，一不小心就容易跑得很快。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在斯隆湖出口处，会有接力队伍的交接点，聚集了不少人。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-083.webp",
      "caption": "Sloan Lake · 5 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 083"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-084.webp",
      "caption": "Left Sloan Lake @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 084"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-085.webp",
      "caption": "Colfax Avenue · 6 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 085"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>离开斯隆湖后，跑者们将再次向西回到科尔法克斯大道。这段路仍然是影子赛道，大约有<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">3英里</span>长。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-086.webp",
      "caption": "Colfax Avenue · 7 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 086"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-087.webp",
      "caption": "Colfax Avenue · 8 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 087"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-088.webp",
      "caption": "Rmcad Sculpture @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 088"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>然后我们会北转离开科尔法克斯大道，前往位于Mile-13的落基山艺术与设计学院（Rocky Mountain College of Art + Design）</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-089.webp",
      "caption": "Mile 13 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 089"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-090.webp",
      "caption": "山路风景 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 090"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-091.webp",
      "caption": "山路转弯 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "山路转弯 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-092.webp",
      "caption": "山顶视野 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 092"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在这里，户外艺术与出色的建筑完美融合，整个校园都散发着丹佛独特的艺术气息。然而，这段路线给我留下最深刻的印象还是：阳光的热烈以及城市热气的升腾。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-093.webp",
      "caption": "Mile 14 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 093"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-094.webp",
      "caption": "Lakewood @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 094"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>之后，我们会经过美丽的莫尔斯公园（Morse Park），进入拉克伍德（Lakewood）的一个隐藏宝藏街区 - 格伦斯社区（The Glens），这里有优雅的阴凉树和白色栅栏，给人一种宁静而舒适的感觉。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-095.webp",
      "caption": "Mile 15 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 095"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-096.webp",
      "caption": "Lakewood · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 096"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>然而，快乐只是短暂的。由于格伦斯社区位于整个赛道的最西端，这意味着我们很快就要折返，然后直面科罗拉多高原上炙热的阳光。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-097.webp",
      "caption": "Run Towards @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 097"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-098.webp",
      "caption": "Run Towards · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 098"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这段距离足足从Mile-16延伸到Mile-20，每一英里都不容易，还好我戴了墨镜，不至于特别晃眼，并且自拍也还不错，脸色被阳光照的很白。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-099.webp",
      "caption": "Run Towards · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 099"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>不过还好，从Lakewood返回丹佛的路段是一段快速的下坡路。从<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">16英里</span>到<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">20英里</span>，我们会经过Whitlock运动中心（靠近Dudley和Colfax），然后沿着Colfax直线下坡。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑者们还会经过很多有趣的建筑和场所，如Big Bunny Motel，Casa Bonita，Lake Steam Baths和美丽的街头艺术。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-100.webp",
      "caption": "Artistic graffiti @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 100"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-101.webp",
      "caption": "Artistic graffiti · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 101"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我就被其中一个涂鸦房子所吸引，然后一位非常友好的路人帮我拍了几张照片。这段路线大部分都可以欣赏到丹佛的天际线，看着市区越来越近，天际线越来越清晰，这也给了我额外的动力去完成这漫长的旅程。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-102.webp",
      "caption": "Run Towards · 4 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 102"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-103.webp",
      "caption": "Run Towards · 5 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 103"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-104.webp",
      "caption": "Run Towards · 6 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 104"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-105.webp",
      "caption": "Run to Downtown @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 105"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>终于，终于，我们在<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">20英里</span>的时候又回到了里高体育场，然后从另一侧再次绕场半圈离开，一来一回，也算在里高体育场混了个脸熟。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-106.webp",
      "caption": "田野风景 · 6 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 106"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-107.webp",
      "caption": "田野风景 · 7 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 107"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>体育场里还有乐队为大家演奏，听着音乐，跑在体育场里，这是属于丹佛马拉松跑者的专属时刻。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-108.webp",
      "caption": "Empower Field @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 108"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-109.webp",
      "caption": "田野风景 · 8 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "田野风景 · 8 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-110.webp",
      "caption": "田野风景 · 9 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "田野风景 · 9 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>可惜我不是橄榄球球迷，要不就为这一啪，跑丹佛马也是无比值得的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>从里高体育场离开，我们会再次穿过埃利奇花园，到达南普拉特河，赛道重新与樱桃溪小径合流。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-111.webp",
      "caption": "Elitch Garden · 5 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 111"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-112.webp",
      "caption": "Elitch Garden · 6 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 112"
    },
    {
