      "caption": "",
      "alt": "丹佛马拉松照片 122"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在这里我又遇到了粉色头发带翅膀的小哥，果然是和我一个起跑区的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Denver-Colfax-Marathon-clean_files/img-123.webp",
